<title>ISRAEL: Mofet Israel Q1 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Mofet Israel Q1 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mofet Israel Technology Fund Ltd reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels except per share)</p>
<p>			   Q1 97	Q1 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  13,433     5,521</p>
<p>Pretax profit	  12,313     4,512</p>
<p>Net profit		7,854     4,313</p>
<p>Earnings per share     0.14	0.08</p>
<p>($1 = 3.395 shekels)</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
